00:00:02,460 --> 00:00:28,070
Together, the friends had managed to seize the amulet and destroy its spell over Cyra and the gods. Loki's deceitful plan had been foiled, and his false play had been ended once and for all. The sinister power of the amulet should never again do any damage to humans or to the gods. Such was the vow the friends took that day.
